      "text": "S No directions and  Registrar's order  with Signatures  17.05.2023 AO No.163 of 2023  Hon'ble Alok Kumar Verma, J.\nPresent Appeal has been filed by the owner of the offending vehicle under Section 173 of the Motor Vehicles Act, 1988 challenging the Award dated 31.01.2023, passed by learned Motor Accident Claims Tribunal/ District Judge, Haridwar in Motor Accident Claim Petition No.28 of 2019, \"Smt.\nFullo and Another vs. Devkumar and Others,\"\nby which, learned Tribunal has awarded a sum of Rs.7,28,000/-(Rupees seven lakh twenty eight thousand) as compensation along with an interest at the rate of 7% per annum from the date of petition till its actual payment.\n2.",
